      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "This stereotype equates Black people with chimpanzees, implying inferiority, primitiveness, or animalistic behavior. It is a deeply rooted racist trope used to dehumanize and demean Black individuals and communities. The meme uses this stereotype to insult 'Obama voters,' who are predominantly Black, by visually associating them with chimpanzees.",
