      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the chimpanzee scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the chimpanzees in the forest scene, as the meme implicitly invites the viewer to identify with or judge the 'Obama voters' by associating them with the chimpanzees. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the framing of the image and text creates an implicit projection where the viewer is positioned as the observer making a judgment about the group being depicted.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
